ngs trained separately for each co-occurrence type in ViCo.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 0]}, 'CBOW': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Continuous Bag-of-Words model, a method for learning word embeddings from co-occurrences in local context windows.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Skip-Gram': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Skip-Gram model, a method for learning word embeddings from co-occurrences in local context windows.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Object-Attribute co-occurrences': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ["Another specific type of co-occurrence used in ViCo, computed from VisualGenome's object and attribute annotations."], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Word2vec': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A type of word embedding, similar to GloVe, learned from large-scale text corpora by modeling textual co-occurrences.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'ELMo': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A contextualized word representation model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'OpenAI GPT': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A pre-trained language model used for contextualized word representations.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'BERT': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A contextualized word representation model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'ViCo embeddings': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A type of word embeddings learned by minimizing a loss function that incorporates co-occurrence information.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Visual Genome': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for estimating visual co-occurrence counts.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Adagrad': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['An optimization algorithm reported to work best for GloVe.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Object-Hypernym (oh) counts': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Counts derived from ImageNet synsets and their ancestors in WordNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 't-SNE plots': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Plots