iption': ['Gated Recurrent Unit, used for processing word embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Wiki': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for training vis-w2v, representing the Wikipedia dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Coco': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for training vis-w2v, representing the MS-COCO dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'MAt-tNet': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['An open-source implementation used to compare localization accuracy with different embeddings on the RefCOCO+ dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'GLOVE+VICO(LINEAR, 100, W/O WORDNET)': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific configuration of the GloVe+ViCo method, using a linear transformation, a 100-dimensional embedding space, and trained without WordNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'COARSE AND FINE CATEGORIES': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Refers to the evaluation of the method on both coarse and fine-grained categories.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'FOUR SEEN/UNSEEN SPLITS': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Refers to the evaluation of the method on four different seen/unseen splits.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, '200-dim': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Specifies the dimensionality (200 dimensions) of the embeddings, clarifying the configuration used in the experiments.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 's(a, w1, w2) = cosine(a, w1) − cosine(a, w2)': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ["The function used to compute scores for GloVe and ViCo, where 'a' is the attribute word, 'w1' and 'w2' are the word embeddings, and cosine(·) is the cosine similarity."], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Object-Hypernym co-occurrences': {'description': ['A specific type of co-occurrence used in ViCo, computed using ImageNet annotations augmented with WordNet hypernyms.', 'A type of co-occurrence analyzed by ViCo, calculated using ImageNet synsets and their ancestors in WordNet. It involves counting c